Use ODRL vocabulary with namespace "https://example.org/handicap-card#".
Use prefix ns with namespace "https://example.org/handicap-card#".

evaluation is an evaluationReport.
evaluation has policy eligibility.
evaluation has policy administrativeHold.
evaluation has conflictStrategy prohibit.
issueAlice is a request.
issueAlice has assignee CivicOffice.
issueAlice has action issueHandicapCard.
issueAlice has target HandicapCardService.
issueAlice has subject Alice.
issueAlice has state aliceState.
issueBob is a request.
issueBob has assignee CivicOffice.
issueBob has action issueHandicapCard.
issueBob has target HandicapCardService.
issueBob has subject Bob.
issueBob has state bobState.
evaluation has validationStatus valid.
issueAlice has unmetConstraint held.
issueAlice has applicablePermission mayIssue.
issueBob has applicablePermission mayIssue.
issueBob has applicableProhibition mustWait.
evaluation has conflict witness(rule 282, "Conflict", ns:evaluation, ns:issueBob, ns:eligibility, ns:mayIssue, ns:administrativeHold, ns:mustWait).
witness(rule 282, "Conflict", ns:evaluation, ns:issueBob, ns:eligibility, ns:mayIssue, ns:administrativeHold, ns:mustWait) is a conflict.
witness(rule 282, "Conflict", ns:evaluation, ns:issueBob, ns:eligibility, ns:mayIssue, ns:administrativeHold, ns:mustWait) has request issueBob.
witness(rule 282, "Conflict", ns:evaluation, ns:issueBob, ns:eligibility, ns:mayIssue, ns:administrativeHold, ns:mustWait) has permissionPolicy eligibility.
witness(rule 282, "Conflict", ns:evaluation, ns:issueBob, ns:eligibility, ns:mayIssue, ns:administrativeHold, ns:mustWait) has permissionRule mayIssue.
witness(rule 282, "Conflict", ns:evaluation, ns:issueBob, ns:eligibility, ns:mayIssue, ns:administrativeHold, ns:mustWait) has prohibitionPolicy administrativeHold.
witness(rule 282, "Conflict", ns:evaluation, ns:issueBob, ns:eligibility, ns:mayIssue, ns:administrativeHold, ns:mustWait) has prohibitionRule mustWait.
evaluation has conflictCount 1.
evaluation has request issueAlice.
issueAlice has decision allowed.
evaluation has request issueBob.
issueBob has decision prohibited.
evaluation has canHappen issueAlice.
